        <!-- Notes -->
        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Firewall (security groups):&lt;/b&gt; EC2 port 8080 open only to CloudFront (AWS prefix list); RDS port 5432 open only to the EC2 security group; no SSH (Session Manager).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not on AWS:&lt;/b&gt; development and tests run fully local (PostgreSQL 18 on each laptop).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not drawn (stretch):&lt;/b&gt; SQS queue for the reassignment trigger, behind app.messaging.sqs.enabled.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Guardrails:&lt;/b&gt; budget campus-hub-monthly ($5 / $20 / $40 alerts); stop EC2 + RDS when idle; terraform destroy after grading." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#545B64;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="752" width="1060" height="70" as="geometry" />
